WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
The gun fires.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.020
A runner sets off on one
full lap of the track.

3
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:10.370
She runs hard the whole way around, every
step adding to the distance she covers.

4
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.450
She crosses the line
exactly where she started.

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.800
Plenty of distance.

6
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.450
Plenty of speed.

7
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.420
So what was her average
velocity, over the whole lap?

8
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.860
In this mission, you'll separate
distance from displacement,

9
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.990
and speed from velocity.

10
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:30.140
Then you'll see why a ball that bounces
straight back at the same speed has still

11
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.530
accelerated.

12
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.890
Your mission: work out what
her average velocity was,

13
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.830
over that one complete lap.
